{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41671","headline":"投赠福建路罗中丞 · 陈陶","name":"投赠福建路罗中丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"越艳听谣不厌听，楼船高卧静南溟。\n未闻建水窥龙剑，应喜家山接女星。\n三捷楷模光典策，一生封爵笑丹青。\n皇恩几日西归去，玉树扶疎正满庭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41671.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41671","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}